  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Primary path",
      "items": [
        "BHNM Active Response Webhook → /webhook?secret=; the secret is the only gate.",
        "Only devices whose stored active_secret matches are notified.",
        "Stale APNs tokens and expired Web Push subscriptions are pruned on send.",
        "Tapping the alert deep-links to incident detail, even from a cold launch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Caddy publishes 80/443; every other container is expose-only.",
        "/admin* needs bcrypt basic_auth plus app-enforced TOTP.",
        "/internal* is answered 403 at the edge — cache reload stays internal.",
        "Proxy calls need X-Proxy-Token; the SSRF guard re-resolves each target."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "External dependencies",
      "items": [
        "BHNM 26.1.02+ — UID identity, pagination, interface detail.",
        "Apple APNs — .p8 key, JWT refreshed every 55 min, sandbox + production.",
        "Web Push — VAPID via FCM / Mozilla autopush.",
        "Let's Encrypt through Caddy ACME; caddy:2.9-alpine pinned by tag."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Reads, state and omissions",
      "items": [
        "Both clients read through Caddy; neither reaches BHNM directly.",
        "incidents, tactical, thresholds and maintenance-map come from memory.",
        "SQLite on a docker volume holds device_tokens and web_push_subscriptions.",
        "Not drawn: benem-admin (edits servers.json) and benem-pwa (static bundle)."
      ]
    }
  ]
